<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Sydney</p>
<p>International tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, second round</p>
<p>Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Kimberly Po (U.S.) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat Rene Simpson (Canada) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) beat Rachel McQuillan (Australia) 7-5</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Men's singles, second round</p>
<p>3-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat 8-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-7 (5-7) 7-5 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>walkover (Woodbridge withdrew injured)</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>0-6 6-4</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 3-6 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
